e section shows a small number of invasive tumor cells  Results are expressed as the average ratio of HER 2 signals  34  to chromosome 17 signals  30  in 18 tumor cell nuclei  A ratio of greater than REMOVED_DATE or equal to REMOVED_DATE indicates  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  neu gene amplification adjusted for chromosome 17 polysomy using PathVysion by Vysis  The results at or near the cutoff point  ranging from REMOVED_DATE   2 2  should be interpreted with caution  Equivocal Amplification   Reference  Journal of Clinical Oncology 25 118 145   REMOVED_CASE_ID   Addendum  2 by Atul K Bhan M D   Electronically signed on Friday REMOVED_MONTH 25   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 01 32 07PM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  ADDENDUM NOTE  REASON  3  ADDITIONAL IMMUNOHISTOCHEMISTRY RESULTS NOTE  The tumor cells analyzed for receptor strains and Her 2 protein expression in block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  show a different profile than the original tumor  which had been characterized as estrogen  and progesterone receptor protein negative  and Her 2 overexpressing on the prior core biopsy   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   reviewed   Morphologically  the tumor cells identified in a lymphatic vessel of the mastectomy specimen   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   resemble the patient s breast carcinoma before initiation of chemotherapy  However  this focus has nearly disappeared on a deeper section  which is why this block was not used for a repeat of receptor and Her 2 stains  It is concluded from those findings that the invasive carcinoma cells identified in the area of the tumor bed most likely represent another primary  which had not been previously sampled and is an incidental finding  Immunostains for estrogen  and progesterone receptor proteins  and for Her 2 protein were also performed on the lymph node showing isolated tumor cells  block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    However  those are non contributory as no tumor cells are represented on the sections provided for immunohistochemical stains  No additional information on the hormone receptor or Her 2 profile of those isolated tumor cells can be provided  Dr Smith was notified about the additional findings by email on REMOVED_DATE  Addendum  3 by Elena F Brachtel M D   Electronically signed on Friday REMOVED_MONTH 02   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 05 41 42PM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  PART A  Breast  Left   Modified Radical Mastectomy PART B  Breast  Left Additional Axillary Tissue   Excision  report_end  , No.
