E x 0 5cm indurated gray white nodule with eccentric focal hemorrhage  The nodule abuts the posterior margin and comes to 0 5cm of the superior margin  1 5cm of the inferior margin  and greater than 2 0cm from all additional margins  0 7cm from this nodule is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm cavity consistent with the previous biopsy site which comes to 0 4cm of the superior margin  0 6cm of the inferior margin  0 5cm of the posterior margin  and greater than 0 2cm from all additional margins  Surrounding the cavity is focally indurated dense gray white fibrous tissue with a poorly delineated indurated area measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm that abuts the posterior margin  This area comes to 0 3cm of the inferior margin  0 9cm of the superior margin  and greater than 2 0cm from all additional margins  Also noted surrounding the cavity is chalky yellow discoloration consistent with fat necrosis and focal hemorrhage  Finally  there is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm firm gray white to tan yellow nodule medially which comes to 0 6cm of the posterior margin  0 7cm of the superior margin  1 6cm of the inferior margin  and greater than 2 0cm from all additional margins  This nodule is also 1 4cm medial to the first described nodule  Representative sections are submitted from medial to lateral as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   with the medial end margin radially sectioned as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   the lateral end margin radially sectioned as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   the medial most nodule as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   the first described nodule as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   the second described indurated area as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and midline cavity as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Final Diagnosis by Melinda J Lerwill M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART   Breast  Right   Re excision  report_end  , Unchecked.
