imen is palpated  No lymph nodes are grossly identified  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of nodular fibrous tissue from the upper outer quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of fibrous tissue from the lower outer quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of fibrous tissue from the lower inner quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of fibrous tissue from the upper inner quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of fibrous tissue from the central  subareolar area  Received in formalin  labeled  right breast additional anterior margin   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm aggregate of multiple irregular portions of tan yellow fibroadipose tissue  Representative sections are submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS  FROZEN SECTION   1  RIGHT AXILLARY SENTINEL NODE  REMOVED_DATE X REMOVED_DATE X REMOVED_DATE CM  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1A  RIGHT AXILLARY SENTINEL NODE  REMOVED_DATE X REMOVED_DATE X REMOVED_DATE CM  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  Final Diagnosis by Ronald Balassanian M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE ADDENDUM NOTE  REASON  1 QUANTITATIVE RESULTS OF IMMUNOHISTOCHEMICAL STAINING FOR RECEPTOR PROTEINS Breast  Right  block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    The tumor cells do not stain for estrogen receptor protein  The tumor cells do not stain for progesterone receptor protein  The tumor cells show strong  3   overexpression of HER 2 c erbB 2  See note  Note  Estrogen and progesterone receptor quantitation  The percent of immunoreactive nuclei in the tumor cells is assessed visually and reported as follows  The tumor cells stain    10  of nuclei stained  Some tumor cells stain  1 to  10  of nuclei stained  Rare tumor cells stain    1  of nuclei stained  The tumor cells do not stain  0  of nuclei stained  HER 2 c erbB 2 quantitation  the tumor cells membra