esh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  additional superior margin  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 4cm fragment of fibroadipose tissue  with a short suture on the superior margin  and a long suture on the lateral margin  The entire specimen is inked in black  and the superior aspect is overinked in blue  No gross lesions are identified within the parenchyma  and the specimen is submitted from lateral to medial in S V  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  R axillary contents  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm irregular fragment of yellow tan fibroadipose tissue  Lymph nodes from this specimen are submitted in W BB  Resident  MELINDA J  FAN  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  BREAST  RIGHT   INTRADUCTAL CARCINOMA  ABUTTING INK AT REMOVED_DATE CM FROM SHORT SUTURE  NO DEFINITIVE INVASION SEEN  AWAIT PERMANENTS  FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  2  BREAST  RIGHT  TISSUE SAMPLED BY SURGEON WITH REQUEST FOR FROZEN   FIBROUS BREAST TISSUE  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  O R  Resident  GARY LETTS  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Eugene Jerome Mark  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  Jaime A Rivera  M D  Simon Kaspar Ashiku  M D  Hasan Bazari  M D  PART A  LYMPH NODES  RIGHT AXILLA   REGIONAL NODE DISSECTI PART B  BREAST  RIGHT  ADDITIONAL SHAVED MARGIN    NCISION PART C  BREAST  RIGHT  ADDITIONAL SHAVED MARGIN    EXCISIO PART D  BREAST  RIGHT  ADDITIONAL SUPERIOR MARGIN    EXCIS PART E  BREAST RIGHT  EXCISION   report_end  , Yes.
