esterone receptor protein  The tumor cells do not show overexpression of HER 2 c erbB 2  See note  Note  These tests were developed and their performance characteristics determined by the Pathology Department at the Massachusetts General Hospital  They have not been cleared or approved by the U S  Food and Drug Administration  FDA   The FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Grace T  McKee MD Signed On  21 REMOVED_MONTH 00 at 15 38 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm fragment of breast with a single long stitch medial  a single short stitch superior and a double stitch lateral  The deep margin is inked black and the anterior margin is inked green  In the inferomedial portion of the specimen there is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm firm white irregular nodule which comes to 0 1cm from the inferior and medial margins  The remaining parenchyma is hemorrhagic with discoloration by blue dye  the latter predominantly located in the lateral half of the specimen  There are also several simple 0 1cm cysts located along the lateral edge of the specimen  Representative sections are submitted as follows  Section code  A  FX 1 radial sections through lateral margin  B D  Tumor from lateral to medial  from inferior half of specimen  E  Radial section through inferior medial margin  F  Additional radial sections through lateral margin  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number are seven parts  Labeled  right axillary sentinel node  consists of two fragments of fibroadipose tissue measuring 3 x 2 x 0 5cm in aggregate  which contains two lymph nodes measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm  The lymph nodes are bivalved and submitted in cassette G  Labeled  right axillary lymph node contents  is a 8 x 7 x 2cm fibrofatty tissue which contains eight lymph nodes ranging from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 1cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm  The lymph nodes are entirely submitted in cassettes H K  Labeled  superior medial right breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm fibrofatty tissue  which is submitted in toto as cassette L  Labeled  right breast  superior lateral  is a 3 x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm unoriented fibrofatty tissue  which is submitted in toto as cassette M  Labeled  right breast  medial  is a 3 x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm unoriented fibrofatty tissue  which is submitted in toto as cassette N  Labeled  right breast  inferior  is a 3 x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm unoriented fibrofatty tissue  which is submitted in toto as cassette O  Labeled  right breast  deep  is a 4 x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm unoriented fibrofatty tissue  which is submitted in toto as cassette P  Gross Description by  MELINDA J  FAN  MD Resident  Mari Mino  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  BREAST  RIGHT  LATERAL GRITTY AREA   FIBROCYSTIC CHANGES  O R  Resident  MELINDA J  FAN  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Lawrence R  Zukerberg  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  LYMPH NODES  RIGHT AXILLA   SENTINEL    EXCISION PART C  LYMPH NODES  RIGHT   AXILLARY CONTENTS    EXCISION PART D  BREAST  RIGHT   SUPERIOR MEDIAL    EXCISION PART E  BREAST  RIGHT   SUPERIOR LATERAL    EXCISION PART F  BREAST  RIGHT   MEDIAL    EXCISION PART G  BREAST  RIGHT   INFERIOR    EXCISION PART H  BREAST  RIGHT   DEEP    EXCISION , No.
