rounding tissue is grey white and fibrofatty with focal gritty  yellow  areas  The specimen also contains a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm ill defined  indurated   grey white mass in the upper outer quadrant  tumor  2   which is separated from  tumor  1 by 6cm of fibrofatty tissue and extends to 2 0cm of the anterior and  2 5cm of the posterior margin  Tumor  2 contains a metallic clip  The  specimen also contains a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm ill defined  tan pink  indurated  mass  tumor  3  within the central breast  which is separated from tumor  1 by 8  cm of fibrofatty tissue and extends to 0 4cm of the anterior margin and greater  than 4cm from the posterior margin  The remainder of the cut surface is  yellow white  fibrofatty tissue with focal nodular areas and cystic areas  consistent with fibrocystic change  Lymph nodes are not detected in the lateral  tissue  The following representative sections are submitted      REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of tumor  1    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of fibrous tissue between tumor  1 and tumor  2    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   tumor  2  entirely submitted    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of fibrofatty tissue between tumor  1 and tumor  3      REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Tumor  3  entirely submitted    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Additional representative sections of nodular fibrofatty tissue     C  Received fresh labeled  right subareolar tissue   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 1cm  piece of yellow soft tissue  which is inked black and submitted in toto in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID      D  Received fresh labeled  right axillary lymph nodes   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE  cm aggregate of fat  which contains multiple lymph nodes ranging from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE  x 0 2cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm  The lymph nodes are submitted entirely as  follows      REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Grossly suspicious lymph node bisected    REMOVED_ACCESSI