ogesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  05 REMOVED_MONTH 98 at 08 28 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and no designation as to site  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm soft  tan pink gelatinous pellet which is submitted in toto as Cassette A  Gross Description by  Jason Corbin Resident  CYTOPATHOLOGY STAFF  A B                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH OUTPATIENT  OFF P CLINIC  REPORTS TO  Leonard Lloyd Ellman  M D  Daniel Benjamin Kopans  M D  Priscilla Slanetz  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   CELLBLOCK   report_end  , Unchecked.
