vity E  biopsy cavity  representative sections F G  biopsy cavity  representative section H  medial aspect of biopsy I  lateral aspect of biopsy J  biopsy cavity  representative section Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  are four separate specimens  Labeled  new superior margin  suture on true margin  right breast biopsy   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm firm  white yellow piece of tissue  Inked  bisected  and entirely submitted in cassette K  Labeled  new medial margin  suture on true margin  right breast biopsy   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm piece of firm  white yellow fibroadipose tissue that is bisected and entirely submitted in cassette L  Labeled  new lateral margin  suture on new margin  right breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm firm  white yellow piece of fibroadipose tissue that is inked  bisected and entirely submitted in cassette M  Labeled  new inferior margin  suture on true margin  right breast biopsy   is REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm piece of white yellow fibroadipose tissue  inked and entirely submitted in cassette N  Labeled  right axillary lymph node   is a REMOVED_DATE x 5  0x 4 0cm piece of fibroadipose tissue  Lymph nodes are dissected and entirely submitted in cassettes O and P  Resident  RUBEN D  CARRASCO  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS  BREAST  RIGHT   RE EXCISION  BIOPSY CAVITY  WITH NO LESIONS LARGE ENOUGH TO FREEZE  AWAIT PERMANENTS  O R  Resident  JUSTIN M  CATES  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Dennis Sgroi  M D  O R  Consulting Pathologist s   H  Thomas Aretz  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Wiley W Souba Jr   M D  Jay Christian Guido  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   RE EXCISION PART B  SOFT TISSUE  RIGHT BREAST   EXCISION PART C  NEW MEDIAL MARGIN  EXCISION PART D  NEW LATERAL MARGIN  EXCISION PART E  NEW INFERIOR MA