n and 4 5cm  from the skin  Towards the medial inner portion of the mastectomy specimen there is a focally hemorrhagic area  measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm which is not firm  The remainder of the parenchyma is fibrofatty  Representative sections of the specimen is submitted as follows  A 1 closest black inked margin  A 2   A 5 further representative sections of biopsy cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  focally hemorrhagic breast parenchyma  A 7 scar  A 8 and A 9 representative sections away from lesion  Lymph nodes from the axillary tail is submitted as follows  A 10 to A 14  single lymph nodes in each cassette  A 15 three possible lymph nodes  A 16 to A 18  possible lymph nodes  A 19 and 20  a representative section of a lymph node mass  measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm  the cut surface of this mass is focally yellow and suspicious for metastasis   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   representative section of the large lymph node measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm with a suspicious cut surface  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  highest left axillary node   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm lymph node  which is submitted entirely in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Gross Dictation by Shabin Nanji M D   on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Shabin Nanji M D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Dennis Sgroi M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A  BREAST  LEFT   MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY PART B  LYMPH NODE  LEFT AXILLA HIGHEST   DISSECTION , Unchecked.
