d inferior margin C  lateral inferior margin D  mid superior margin E  extreme lateral deep margin F  extreme medial inferior margin Labeled  left axillary contents   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 4 0cm fibrofatty tissue specimen  from which lymph nodes are dissected out and submitted entirely in cassettes G I  Resident  Frank P  Fechner  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  Barbara Joyce Nath  M D  PART A  BREAST TUMOR  LEFT   RE EXCISION PART B  LYMPH NODE  LEFT AXILLA   EXCISION , Unchecked.
