eep margin  3 5cm from the lateral margin  11 0cm from the medial margin  1 5cm from the superior margin  and 7 0cm from the inferior margin  The remaining breast tissue is composed of lobulated  white fibrous tissue with focal  blue domed cysts  No additional masses or anomalies are noted  SECTION CODE  A B  Biopsy cavity in relation to closest superior margin  C   Biopsy cavity in relation to closest deep margin  D   Biopsy cavity in relation to skin  E   Central section of biopsy cavity  F   Representative lobulated fibrous parenchyma from upper outer quadrant  G   Representative fibrous parenchyma from medial aspect  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left axillary contents  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm portion of adipose tissue from which multiple lymph nodes are identified ranging from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm up to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm  A representative section from each is submitted in Cassettes H K  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left axillary sentinel node   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm lymph node with a small amount of attached adipose tissue  The lymph node is bisected and is entirely submitted in Cassette L  Gross Description by  JANINE L  DUDAC                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   MASTECTOMY PART B  LYMPH NODES  LEFT AXILLA   DISSECTION PART C  LYMPH NODE  LEFT AXILLARY SENTINEL   EXCISION   report_end  , Unchecked.
