y areas of fat necrosis and hemorrhage which grossly abut the superior  anterior and deep resection margins at multiple areas  The remainder of the breast parenchyma is composed of predominantly adipose tissue  Section code  A E  representative sections of biopsy cavity in relation to closest resection margin  F  medial margin  en face  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left axillary lymph nodes   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm fragment of adipose tissue  dissected to reveal multiple grossly unremarkable lymph nodes ranging from REMOVED_DATE to 1 0cm in greatest dimension  Representative sections of the lymph nodes are submitted in cassette G K  Resident  SAHA SADEGHI  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  Alphonse Taghian  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  LYMPH NODES  LEFT AXILLA   EXCISION , Unchecked.
