rris  M D  GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and no designation as to site  are 2 cores of fibrofatty tissue ranging from REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm to REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm which are submitted in toto as cassette A  Gross Description by  JIM BRADLEY Resident  WEN JING  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH OUTPATIENT  OFF P CLINIC  REPORTS TO  Elizabeth A Rafferty  M D  Charles Harris Weiss  M D  Daniel Benjamin Kopans  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT  2 O CLOCK   CORE BIOPSIES , Unchecked.
